Package: archweb-os
Version: 20.1.2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nodejs (>= 18), electron (>= 22)
Maintainer: ArchWeb OS Development Team <support@archweb.local>
Description: ArchWeb OS for Kids / Linux Desktop Version
 ArchWeb OS is a highly customized and beautiful desktop simulation of Arch Linux
 crafted in React, Vite and Electron, optimized for education and productivity.
 This package includes the native system runners, file manager integrations,
 terminal interfaces, and desktop widgets.

HOW TO INSTALL ON LINUX (Debian/Ubuntu/Arch):
1. Debian/Ubuntu/Mint (.deb):
   sudo dpkg -i archweb.deb
   sudo apt-get install -f # install missing dependencies
2. Arch Linux:
   pacman -U archweb.pkg.tar.zst (compiled via makepkg)
3. Running manually:
   chmod +x ./baslat.sh
   ./baslat.sh
